  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a list of the details for <b>id</b>, specifically those requested in <b>params</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>ID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/id" target="_blank">id</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Avatar" target="_blank">avatar</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Prim" target="_blank">prim</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> that is in the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a>&#32;or adjacent regions<a href="#id_Parameter" target="_blank">*</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
